{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"id":"ayangweb.BongoCat","latestVersion":"1.1.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"🐱 跨平台桌宠 BongoCat，为桌面增添乐趣！","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/BongoCatPet/BongoCat/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"🐱 Cross-platform desktop pet BongoCat, adding fun to your desktop!","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"🐱 Cross-platform desktop pet BongoCat, adding fun to your desktop!\nFeatures:\n- Compatible with macOS, Windows, and Linux (x11).\n- Synchronizes mouse movements or keyboard taps based on your keyboard or mouse actions.\n- Supports importing custom models to freely create your unique cat avatar.\n- Fully open-source with transparent code—absolutely no user data collection.\n- Works offline—no internet required, ensuring user privacy.","tags":[]},"zh-CN":{"description":"🐱 跨平台桌宠 BongoCat，为桌面增添乐趣！","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/BongoCatPet/BongoCat/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"🐱 跨平台桌宠 BongoCat，为桌面增添乐趣！\n功能介绍\n- 适配 macOS、Windows 和 Linux (x11)。\n- 根据据键盘或鼠标操作，同步移动鼠标或敲击键盘。\n- 支持导入自定义模型，自由打造专属猫咪形象。\n- 完全开源，代码公开透明，绝不收集任何用户数据。\n- 支持离线运行，无需联网，保护用户隐私。","name":"BongoCat","packageUrl":"https://github.com/BongoCatPet/BongoCat","publisher":"ayangweb","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/BongoCatPet","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/BongoCatPet/BongoCat/releases/tag/v1.1.0","tags":[]}},"longDescription":"🐱 跨平台桌宠 BongoCat，为桌面增添乐趣！\n功能介绍\n- 适配 macOS、Windows 和 Linux (x11)。\n- 根据据键盘或鼠标操作，同步移动鼠标或敲击键盘。\n- 支持导入自定义模型，自由打造专属猫咪形象。\n- 完全开源，代码公开透明，绝不收集任何用户数据。\n- 支持离线运行，无需联网，保护用户隐私。","name":"BongoCat","packageUrl":"https://github.com/BongoCatPet/BongoCat","publisher":"ayangweb","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/BongoCatPet","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/BongoCatPet/BongoCat/releases/tag/v1.1.0","tags":[]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64","x86"],"detailPath":"versions/1.1.